<title>UK: Low factory gate prices good for RPI - Knight.</title>
<headline>Low factory gate prices good for RPI - Knight.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Another &quot;outstanding&quot; set of producer price numbers means the UK now has an &quot;unclouded outlook for prices in the High Street this spring,&quot; Angela Knight, UK Treasury minister said.  </p>
<p>DATA SHOWED</p>
<p>===========</p>
<p>UK FEB OUTPUT PRICES UNCH MM,+1.3% YY, INPUT PRICES -6.6% YY, S/A -0.5% MM</p>
<p>UK FEB S/A OUTPUT PRICES EX F,D,T,P +0.1% MM, +0.6% YY</p>
<p>-- John Speck, London Newsroom +44 171 542-8663</p>
